# Un'Goro Crater (Horde) - Rares companion (pack butler-routes-completionist, v1).
# An opportunistic sweep for the 3 confirmed rank-4 rares of Un'Goro
# Crater. Run it in its own Polestar tab at the end of the Horde core
# route or standalone. EVERY goal is optional: a rare that is not up
# never holds the route. Spawn points and levels are the local Forever
# game data (questie-forever), verified for the Horde side. Signature
# drops are items whose SOLE dropper is the rare (null rate stated, per
# the Feralas calibration): the Matriarch and Uhk'loc each carry one;
# Clutchmother Zavas has none and ships as a kill goal with a
# come-back-later note (level 54, one above the Horde 47-53 band). All
# three rares are a single confirmed point each, so no step loops. No
# treasures ship: no lootable fixed container exists in the data that is
# not core-owned quest furniture (see
# docs/ungoro-horde-companions-inventory.md). No tame lines ship (no data
# flag; the core guide kills devilsaurs for the Sprout but carries no
# Hunter lines - see docs/companion-unverified.md). Respawn timers are
# unconfirmed anywhere, so none are stated. No rare in this guide is a
# giver, ender, or objective of any Horde-contracted quest.
guide butler-routes-completionist/ungoro-horde-rares
title Un'Goro Crater (Horde) - Rares
levels 47-53
zone Un'Goro Crater
faction Horde
category Collectibles
folder Companions
keywords ungoro, horde, rares, companions
coords live
version 1

step Ravasaur Matriarch — the east crater

  zone map 1449

  goto 62.35,65.95
  kill 6581 optional
  collect 286616 "Matriarch's Prowlers" optional
  note Level 50 rare at its single confirmed point in the east crater; its sole drop is the Matriarch's Prowlers (no rate in the data). No quest takes it.
  note Also drops ordinary greens and raptor bits; respawn timer unconfirmed.

step Uhk'loc — the north crater

  zone map 1449

  goto 68.48,12.66
  kill 6585 optional
  collect 285284 "Balanced Knives of the Bandit" optional
  note Level 53 rare at its single confirmed point in the north crater; its sole drop is the Balanced Knives of the Bandit (no rate in the data). No quest takes it.
  note Also drops ordinary greens and gorilla bits; respawn timer unconfirmed.

step Clutchmother Zavas — the south-east (come back later)

  zone map 1449

  goto 48.73,85.35
  kill 6582 optional
  note Level 54 rare at its single confirmed point in the south-east; one level above the Horde 47-53 band, so work it after the core route. The data shows no sole drop for it, so there is nothing to collect. No quest takes it.
  note Drops ordinary greens and insect bits; respawn timer unconfirmed.
